    "content": [
     {
      "type": "text",
      "text": "Mechanical thrombectomy is indicated for large vessel occlusion (LVO) - typically internal carotid, middle cerebral (M1/M2), or basilar artery. MT can be performed up to 24 hrs from last known well in selected pts using advanced imaging (CT perfusion or MRI diffusion-perfusion mismatch)."
     }
    ]
   },
